+# Historical context evidence — RED_READY checkpoint
+
+## Frozen inputs and bounded sequence
+
+Author base: `68703a6714d7e1d91a1cc3751a292fec8599fea6`, descendant of
+`50af7923ff9094ac8e7a175d3256126204b4da41`. The three ratified contracts
+(`legacy-context-observation-v1.md`, `hardware-expectation-v1.md`, and
+`qa-plan.md` section 10) and the common author brief are unchanged from that
+entry commit in this worktree.
+
+1. Introduce discriminating pure tests A3/A4/A5/A8 and an importable nominal
+   JSON decoder. No validator implementation at this checkpoint.
+2. Lead runner reviews and records causal RED; author does not execute tests.
+3. Only after the observed RED and lead continuation: implement strict parsing,
+   then return GREEN_READY for lead execution/non-regression.
+4. After lead GREEN: author the opt-in historical fixture producer and the
+   transferred derived SetUp guard, source only. Independent native source
+   review remains required; compilation/GL execution remain NON_EXECUTE.
+
+This checkpoint intentionally is **not integration-ready**: the decoder does
+not validate evidence and must not be connected to collectors or adapters.
+
+## Runner command and oracles
+
+From this isolated worktree root, lead only, through Context Mode:
+
+```text
+python -B -m unittest discover -s scripts/tests/verification_context -v
+```
+
+Nominal decode, absent observation, Unicode preservation, valid unavailable
+records, and effect sentinels should pass with the scaffold. Duplicate records,
+duplicate JSON keys, missing fields, wrong attribution, invalid types/identity,
+bad Unicode/limits, contradictory qualification, noncurrent/old/ambiguous-core
+and falsely matched software must fail by discriminating assertions. An import
+error, no tests discovered, toolchain/context absence, or sentinel harness
+failure is not an acceptable causal RED.
+
+## Scope of these tests
+
+- A3: unique strict JSON observation, format/types and complete required fields.
+- A4: exact target and identity, Unicode scalars/control rejection, 4096-scalar
+  boundary, no whitespace/case/normalization change, no ambient environment.
+- A5: per-case attribution and CPU/software names/profiles cannot qualify as
+  historical hardware observations. Complete discovery/JUnit population and
+  assertion/skip precedence belong to the collector, not this parser.
+- A8: separate cases/requests, reread mutation and caller/result independence.
+- Present UNVERIFIED/UNAVAILABLE and INVALID_REQUEST records remain structured
+  data, not test verdicts. Unknown observed fields remain null; software or a
+  mismatch can be reported as unavailable but can never be MATCHED_EXPECTATION.
+- Import execution and parsing are guarded against filesystem, process,
+  network, environment and native dependency access. Source acquisition by the
+  test runner occurs before the guards; no native executable is invoked.
+
+No tests, build, engine, rendering, benchmark, installation or cloud operation
+were executed by the author. C++ producer not authored at RED_READY. No CPU/GPU
+performance or native hardware behavior is demonstrated by synthetic records.
